# The empty states of the panels: what to do next, and a prompt for the agent.

empty-ask = Ask the agent
empty-scene-view = The scene shows here. Open a scene from the Scenes panel, or make a new one with File → New scene.
empty-prompt-scene-view = Make a first scene for this project: a floor, a light, a camera and three objects to look at.
empty-game-view = The scene through a document camera shows here. Add a camera to the scene (Entity → Create → Create a camera).
empty-prompt-game-view = Add a camera to the scene that frames the main objects, and name it Front.
empty-hierarchy = The scene has no entities. Press + to make one, or drag an asset from the Project panel into the scene.
empty-prompt-hierarchy = Fill the scene with a floor, a light and a few objects from the assets of the project.
empty-inspector = Select an entity in the Scene view or in the hierarchy to see its components.
empty-prompt-inspector = Explain the components of the selected entity and what each field does.
empty-notes = No notes yet. Pin a note on an entity or a place with Entity → Add a note.
empty-prompt-notes = Look at the scene and add notes where something needs work.
empty-tags = No tags yet. Add a tag to an entity in its inspector to group entities.
empty-prompt-tags = Give the entities of the scene tags by their kind (furniture, lights, cameras).
empty-scenes = The project has no scenes. Make one with File → New scene.
empty-prompt-scenes = Make a new scene for this project and open it.
empty-project = The project has no assets. Drop a file here to import it, or press Get assets.
empty-prompt-project = Find assets for this scene (a floor texture and two models) with free licences and import them.
empty-timeline = The scene has no sequence. Make one with Sequence → New sequence to animate the scene over time.
empty-prompt-timeline = Make a sequence of ten seconds where the camera moves around the main object.
empty-rules = The scene has no rules. Press New rule to check a place, a distance or a budget at each save.
empty-prompt-rules = Suggest rules for this scene (no object under the floor, no overlap) and add them.
empty-material = Select an entity with a model or a shape to see its material.
empty-prompt-material = Make a material for the selected entity that looks like brushed steel.
empty-lighting = The lighting of the scene shows here: its environment, its lights and its effects.
empty-prompt-lighting = Light the scene for a calm evening look and explain the changes.
empty-variants = The scene has no variants. Save a variant to keep another version of the scene beside it.
empty-prompt-variants = Make a variant of the scene with the furniture in another place.
empty-character = Select an entity with a character to see its rig, its sockets and its clips.
empty-prompt-character = Set up the selected character: its rig, a hand socket and a walk clip.
empty-animator = Select an entity with an animator to see its states and its transitions.
empty-prompt-animator = Make an animator for the selected character with idle and walk states.
empty-clips = Select an entity with a model to see its clips.
empty-prompt-clips = Put a wave clip of the selected character on the timeline at the playhead.
empty-simulation = The project has no simulations. A plugin with a simulation adds it here.
empty-prompt-simulation = Explain how a plugin adds a simulation to this project.
empty-build = Run the build to see the size of each entry and the checks of the project.
empty-prompt-build = Build the project, then tell me which entries are over their budgets.
empty-embed = Build the project first; then the player and its snippet for a web page show here.
empty-prompt-embed = Give me the snippet to put the player of this project on a web page.
empty-baselines = No shots yet. Take a shot of a scene, then add it as a baseline of the project.
empty-prompt-baselines = Take a shot of each scene from its front camera and add them as baselines.
empty-render-queue = The queue is empty. Add a contact sheet or a clip of a sequence.
empty-prompt-render-queue = Render a clip of the first sequence of the project at 30 frames per second.
empty-frame-index = No frame yet. Index the project to draw each sequence at each camera and moment.
empty-prompt-frame-index = Index the frames of the project and tell me which frames changed since the last index.
empty-performance = The frame statistics show here while the scene draws.
empty-prompt-performance = Look at the frame statistics and the cost of each entity, and suggest what to make cheaper.
empty-bench = No bench runs yet. Press Run to measure the scene in the player.
empty-prompt-bench = Run the bench of the project and explain the results against the budgets.
empty-budgets = The project has no budgets. Set a limit beside the values of the last bench.
empty-prompt-budgets = Set quality budgets for this project from the last bench, with some room above each value.
empty-asset-build = No asset build yet. Run the build of the assets to make the files of the player.
empty-prompt-asset-build = Build the assets of the project and tell me about the ones that fail.
empty-rights = The project has no rights records. Each asset needs one; make it with New record… in this panel or in the import dialog.
empty-prompt-rights = Check the rights of each asset of the project and list the ones with a problem.
empty-approvals = No approvals wait. The release rules of the project name the roles that approve.
empty-prompt-approvals = Explain which approvals the release of this project needs.
empty-release = Run the release check to see the problems that stop a release.
empty-prompt-release = Run the release check and fix the problems you can.
empty-export = Pick a scene and press Export to make a GLB file of it.
empty-prompt-export = Export the open scene as a GLB file and check it.
empty-activity = No activity yet. Edits, saves and the turns of the agents show here.
empty-prompt-activity = Tell me what changed in the project today.
empty-console = The log is empty. Messages of the page, the worker, the server and the plugins show here.
empty-prompt-console = Look at the log of the page and tell me about the errors.
empty-problems = No problems. The rules, the assets, the rights and the plugins report here.
empty-prompt-problems = Check the scene against its rules and the assets of the project.
empty-search = Type to find a command, an entity, an asset or a page of the docs.
empty-prompt-search = Show me the commands that edit the selected entity.
empty-history = No edits yet. Each edit is a step here; press a step to go back to it.
empty-prompt-history = Tell me the edits of this session in short.
empty-review = No change sets wait. The changes of the agents wait here for you.
empty-prompt-review = Review the open scene and suggest changes as a change set.
empty-plugins = The project has no plugins. Add a plugin of the checkout, or make a new one.
empty-prompt-plugins = Make a new plugin with a component that I can add to entities.
empty-jobs = No jobs yet. Builds, shots, renders, benches and the runs of the project show here.
empty-prompt-jobs = Run the checks of the project and tell me the result.
empty-vcs = The project has no changes. Edits that you save show here with their diffs.
empty-prompt-vcs = Explain the changes of the project since the last commit.
empty-instructions = The project has no instructions for the agents. Add an AGENTS.md file to the project.
empty-prompt-instructions = Write an AGENTS.md for this project from its scenes and its rules.
empty-tasks = No tasks yet. Start a background task from the agent panel.
empty-prompt-tasks = Start a background task that checks each scene against its rules.
empty-terminal = The terminals of the project run in the studio. Open the project from the studio.
empty-prompt-terminal = Explain how to open a terminal of this project.
empty-agent = The agents work in the studio. Open the project from the studio to talk with an agent.
empty-prompt-agent = What can you do in this project?
empty-project-settings = The settings of the project file show here.
empty-prompt-project-settings = Explain the settings of the project file.
empty-shortcuts = The key map shows here on a keyboard.
empty-prompt-shortcuts = Suggest keys for the commands that I use most.
empty-preferences = The settings of the editor show here.
empty-prompt-preferences = Explain the preferences of the editor.
